# Check text files out with LF on every platform. Without this, Windows clones
# (core.autocrlf defaults to true, including on GitHub's Windows runners) get
# CRLF working copies, which oxfmt --check rejects — so `npm run format:check`
# would fail on a fresh clone even with nothing wrong. The repository already
# stores LF, so this only changes what lands in the working tree.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
